                    {
                        "name":  "places/ChIJSxaBohGvQjQRLvt37mEHcoY/reviews/ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURmcXBqb3hRRRAB",
                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "a year ago",
                        "rating":  4,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "Passing by in 2025/1\n\nThere are many breakfast shops nearby. I was drawn in by the menu and decided to sit down.\n\nThe restaurant is clean and bright, suitable for eating and chatting with friends. Ordering is done via QR code. This time I ordered the No. 6 Black Burger, and I was pleasantly surprised. It was delicious; the shrimp cake was crispy on the outside and tender on the inside, a great combination with the burger bun. I\u0027d like to come back and try other flavors next time.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "2025/1路過\n\n附近很多早餐店，路過被菜單吸引就入座。\n店內乾淨明亮，適合跟朋友來吃順便聊天，採QR code點餐，這次點了六號黑堡，有驚艷到，很好吃，蝦餅外酥內嫩，搭配漢堡皮很不錯，下次會想再來嘗試其他口味。",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                         },
                        "authorAttribution":  {
                                                  "displayName":  "Lulu",
                                                  "uri":  "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114398821210644521212/reviews",
                                                  "photoUri":  "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXZSmmACPUGltDiydFXkwtihvbbjqPE4tnLeBZ2kb4sdeJ56plB=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba6"
                                              },
                        "publishTime":  "2025-01-05T12:47:52.369444Z",
                        "flagContentUri":  "https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURmcXBqb3hRRRAB\u0026d=17924085\u0026t=1",
                        "googleMapsUri":  "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURmcXBqb3hRRRAB!2m1!1s0x3442af11a281164b:0x86720761ee77fb2e"
