                    {
                        "name":  "places/ChIJSxaBohGvQjQRLvt37mEHcoY/reviews/ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJYVkxTDdZNktLalBBEAE",
                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "a year ago",
                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "This is an absolute gem of a restaurant! I got a 25% discount on delivery through Pandabox. The burger bun arrived perfectly cooked, not soggy even with lettuce and ketchup inside. The shrimp patty was almost as big as the bun, so you could get a satisfying bite every time. The fries, while just okay, were thoughtfully sprinkled with pepper and served with ketchup! The black tea wasn\u0027t too sweet either, even less sweet than the slightly sweetened version from Mei Chi City, which suited my taste perfectly.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "絕對的寶藏店舖，pandabox 25%折扣的外送訂單。到手後漢堡皮在內含生菜和番茄醬的情況下不會濕濕軟軟，蝦排幾乎和漢堡麵包一樣大，每一口都咬得到。薯條雖然口味普通，有灑上胡椒粉也有附上番茄醬，細心度滿分！紅茶也不會太甜，比美芝城微糖還不甜，很符合我的口味。",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                         },
